        "text": "Finding hotels in Paris that perfectly combine a swimming pool, free breakfast, a €150-€250 nightly budget, and proximity (within 2 km) to the Eiffel Tower for October 2024 is exceptionally challenging. Hotels with swimming pools in this prime location are predominantly luxury establishments, often exceeding the specified budget. Similarly, \"free breakfast\" is frequently an additional cost in Parisian hotels.\n\nThe options below prioritize hotels with a swimming pool and reasonable proximity to the Eiffel Tower, while attempting to align as closely as possible with your budget. Please note that for some options, breakfast may be available at an additional cost, or the nightly rate might be at the higher end or slightly above your requested budget to accommodate",
